## 7. User Personas

### Persona 1: Property Professional

Role: Real estate agent or property manager.

Goal: Easily post and update property listings.

Challenge: Keeping property information accurate and updated.

Needs: A simple website where they can manage listings without difficulty.

### Persona 2: Local Sponsor

Role: Small business owner.

Goal: Promote their business to people in the neighborhood.

Challenge: Reaching local customers.

Needs: An easy way to submit advertisements and get them approved.

These personas are working assumptions based on the project requirements. They will be updated after the interview.

## 8. User Stories

1. As a property professional, I want to add property listings so that people can find available homes.

2. As a property professional, I want to edit listings so that property information stays updated.

3. As a visitor, I want to search by location so that I can find homes near me.

4. As a visitor, I want to filter by price so that I can find homes within my budget.

5. As a local sponsor, I want to post advertisements so that nearby customers can learn about my business.

6. As an administrator, I want to approve property listings so that incorrect information is not published.

7. As an administrator, I want to review sponsor advertisements so that the information is accurate.

8. As a visitor, I want a website that is easy to navigate so that I can find information without difficulty.

