## 12. Content Approval Workflow

Our platform needs an approval process to make sure property listings and local business advertisements are accurate and trustworthy.

1. A property professional or local sponsor submits their content.
2. The content is marked as Pending.
3. An administrator reviews the information, images, and permissions.
4. The administrator checks that property details and sponsor claims are accurate.
5. The administrator approves or rejects the content.
6. Only approved listings and advertisements appear on the website.
7. If information changes, the content must be reviewed again.

This process helps protect visitors from incorrect information and keeps the platform trustworthy.

